==History==
2024
*The Cannon's Evolution [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 15/11/2024.
*On 14/11/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (14/11/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Cannon's Barrage Tower damage by 75%.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Cannon's Barrage damage by 10%.
*On 4/3/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Evolved Cannon's attack time interval to 1 second (from 0.9 second).
*On 5/5/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (5/5/2025)|May 2025 Update]], decreased the Evolved Cannon's Barrage radius to 2 tiles (from 2.5 tiles).
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)|Balance Update]], decreased the Evolved Cannon's Barrage damage by 14%.
*On 1/12/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|December 2025 Update]], decreased the Evolved Cannon's Barrage damage by 8%.
2026

* On 6/4/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Evolved Cannon's damage by 5%

