==Trivia==
*The word "''Cannon''" comes from the Akkadian word "''𒄀''" (''qanû''), meaning reed. Cannons were invented in China during the twelfth century. It was most likely developed in parallel or as an evolution of an earlier gunpowder weapon called the fire lance. Cannons were used for warfare by the late thirteenth century in the Yuan dynasty and spread throughout Eurasia in the fourteenth century. During the late Middle Ages, large and small cannons were developed for siege and field battles. The cannon replaced prior siege weapons such as the trebuchet. After the late Middle Ages, most large cannons were abandoned in favor of greater numbers of lighter, more maneuverable field artillery.
*The Evolved Cannon's ability is inspired by the Eagle Artillery from Clash of Clans, similarly to its wings.
*Among all evolved [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]] that can attack, the Evolved Cannon is tied with [[Tesla/Evolution|Tesla]] for the shortest range of all buildings, with a range of 5.5 tiles.
*Although Cannons themselves can only target ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]], the [[King's Tower|King Tower]]'s cannon can target both air and ground troops. This might be because the cannon is elevated on the tower.
*The Cannon is unavailable in multiple [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|special game modes]]. More specifically:
** It is 1 of 20 cards that is unavailable in [[Mirror]] mode, the others being [[Minions]], [[Mortar]], [[Tesla]], [[Goblin Hut]], [[Tombstone]], [[Bomb Tower]], [[Inferno Tower]], [[Barbarian Hut]], [[Furnace]], [[Elixir Collector]], [[Freeze]], [[Clone]], [[X-Bow]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Skeleton King]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Mighty Miner]], [[Little Prince]], and the [[Monk]].
** It is unavailable in [[Global Spell|The Floor is Healing]] sub-[[:Category:Modes|mode]] of the Global Spell game mode, much like other building cards, as well as the [[Cannon Cart]].
*The Cannon’s Evolution is the subject of an [[Emotes|Emote]].
*The initial balance change for Evolved Cannon on the [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/3/2025)|4/3/2025 balance changes]] was a 6% damage decrease, but it was changed to an attack time interval increase to 1 second (from 0.9 seconds) [https://royaleapi.com/blog/season-69-balance-wip-march-2025 last minute].
*Before the Cannon Evolution's release, it was made it so that the Evolved Cannon's barrage damage would only deal 25% of its full damage to [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Towers]].

